static const char __pyx_k_non_blind_py_Non_blind_image_de[] = "\nnon_blind.py\n\nNon-blind image deconvolution with space-variant regularization\nand adaptive noise modelling.\n\nReference:\n    \"Adaptive Non-Blind Image Deblurring with Space-Variant Gradient\n     and Noise Modelling\" \342\200\224 Qingsong Wang et al.\n\nKey ideas ported from the reference implementation:\n    1. Lp regularization on image gradients (hyper-Laplacian, \316\261 \342\210\210 (0, 2]).\n    2. Lp fidelity for the noise term (\316\261_n via KL divergence estimation).\n    3. Space-variant \316\273(x,y) per-pixel regularization weight derived from\n       local gradient statistics vs. estimated noise standard deviation.\n    4. 1D \316\273-interpolation: build a library of restored images for a\n       geometric grid of \316\273 values, then interpolate per-pixel.\n    5. Two-stage pipeline: first pass with \316\261_n = \316\261 (gradient prior),\n       second pass with KL-estimated \316\261_n.\n\nDependencies: numpy, scipy, pywt (PyWavelets).\n";
